OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 19 JAN
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,11,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,12,     Gbeyond, including a live concert
OL,13,     Gfrom renowned Baroque vocal group
OL,14,     GVox Luminis in Wigmore Hall in
OL,15,     GLondon.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Dvorak
OL,17,     GKate Molleson explores the life
OL,18,     Gand loves of Antonin Dvorak.
OL,19,     GToday, one of the guiding forces
OL,20,     Gin everything he did and created
OL,21,     G- his nearest and dearest.
