OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined by bass-
OL,6,     Gbaritone Gerald Finley ahead of
OL,7,     Ghis performance with the LSO, and
OL,8,     Gpianist Samson Tsoy performs live
OL,9,     Gin the studio.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,13,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     GDomingo Hindoyan conducts the
OL,15,     GRoyal Liverpool Philharmonic
OL,16,     GOrchestra in Richard Strauss'
OL,17,     GAlso Sprach Zarathustra, and
OL,18,     GMariam Batsashvili joins them for
OL,19,     GLiszt's Piano Concerto No 2.
